    "body": "local commit 803d976 on issue/156-stock-in-stamp (not pushed yet). Every op with a non-stock source now has a stock term in its stamp: presence, placement, mesh signature, shape kind and size. The set is `operation::reads_setup_stock`, because `collect_job` hands the stock to every such kind. Pinned by the `stock_stamp` suite (4 tests; 3 fail on main). Saved projects will see part-sourced ops Stale once. The 7 lathe failures in the full app run are already red on main (#159), not this change.\n",
